<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>title</key>
	<string>MemTrim 自动恢复</string>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>自动深度优化（非官方附加功能）</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>检测到持续内存压力时仅作标记；压力恢复正常且系统空闲内存连续满足条件 20 秒后，才请求一次原版深度优化。每次请求后冷却 15 分钟。深度优化本质上会主动制造内存压力，仍可能导致后台应用重载。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>启用自动恢复优化</string>
			<key>defaults</key>
			<string>com.local.memtrim.autorecovery</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>Enabled</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<false/>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.local.memtrim.autorecovery.changed</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>安全限制</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>检测到警告或临界压力时不发送自动请求；原服务忙碌、状态不可确认、系统余量不足或监测接口失效时跳过。自动请求不代表原任务一定被接受或完成。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>查看运行状态</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>mtar_status</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>冷启动或守护程序重启后也等待 15 分钟。持续压力观察 8 秒；恢复后系统空闲页需达到 max(128 MiB, 物理内存 3%)，连续稳定 20 秒。请求最迟 30 分钟过期。原 MemTrim 总开关必须开启。仅为实验版，尚无真机兼容保证。</string>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
